      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I think buffing up the in-app article page to keep people up to date with the latest announcements and update notes posted in the Discord would be great to have, especially for those on platforms where it's not exactly easy to check otherwise. It would also breathe some life into that tab considering it seems to hardly be used now a days. As for the forum, there's lots of hopes that with the changes coming that there'll be more aggressive promotion of it so more people are aware of its existence and become more inclined to use it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
