      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I guess the real idea is to make it stupid obvious when VRChat has been updated, it being super easy to find out what's new and do it all through the game client because discord pings and steam patch notes are not getting through to most people in my experience.\n\nThe exact means isn't important, just that you can be kept up-to-date for the most part by just playing VRChat.\n\nPromoting the Ask Forums would be a very cool bonus, but you make a good point it being difficult on Quest to open up, so advertising it through other means it probably a better idea.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
