  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-01-19T08:57:34.304Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Whenever there's new patch notes for the game client/SDK or a new developer update, send out a system notification to all VRChat users that asks them if they want to open up a weblink on their device and read it on the corresponding VRChat Ask Forum thread.\n\nI strongly believe this would help make people more aware of the ask forums, which VRChat seem to want users to start interacting more with.\n\nAnecdotally there's many, many users who are not joined on the VRC discord and therefore won't get notified when there's an update, and this would help keep everyone in the loop of bugfixes and features.",
